      "text": "Bacca difficile da trovare al di fuori di Hoenn\nusata per creare Pokémelle che aumentano\nla Bellezza del Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Used to make Pokéblocks that will enhance your\nBeauty, this Berry is rare in other regions.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "うつくしさに　磨きを　かける　ための\nポロックを　つくるとき　使われる。\nほかの　地方では　めずらしい　きのみ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用于制作宝可方块，\n制作出来的宝可方块可用来打磨美丽。\n在其他地区很少见的树果。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Se utiliza en la producción de Pokécubos que potencian\nla belleza. Es una baya muy rara en otras regiones.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    }
